Cognitive Kernel GAIA

This project includes a lightweight multi-agent framework and related web,
vision, and evaluation utilities.

The maintainers should preserve attribution for third-party ideas or code
that influenced this repository. Internal notes mention inspiration or prior
work from:

- Hugging Face smolagents
- CK-V2 web-browser and code-executor components
- rollback-project prompt/data processing

Before publishing a formal release, review the exact source files for copied
third-party code and keep any required upstream license notices with the
corresponding files.
